het verlangen naar echtheid terug: waarom vinden we het zo belangrijk dat ervaringen authentiek zijn? De korte stukken verbinden persoonlijke observaties met de ongeschreven regels van contact met anderen. Deze derde bundeling van haar columns uit Volkskrant Magazine verzamelt afzonderlijke overpeinzingen over het dagelijks leven.","work_id":987160003,"evidence":[{"note":"Distinct2015thirdVolkskrantMagazinecolumncollection, exactDutchPaperback9789025445874. Publisherdistributeddescription andauthorCV bindHannaBervoets; KBprimarypersonHannaMarleenBervoets1984 is nottranslator. Fullnamecreditresolution based on sameISBN/title/publication andauthorCV, no author merge.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p394067029","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p391131303"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-061.json#221","checked_at":"2026-11-03T12:14:47.005Z"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-amendment-027.json","sources":["https://www.donner.nl/producten/en-alweer-bleven-we-ongedeerd-9789025445874/","https://thisishowweread.be/en-alweer-bleven-we-ongedeerd/","https://www.hannabervoets.com/gallery/HannaBervoetsEnglish2022.pdf","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p394067029","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p391131303"]},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"note":"ExactsourcecoverId present but providerbulkarchive notavailable. No no-cover-existence claim; sharedbrowserresolver mightshowrealfront, notyetproven. No imageimport until actualvisualreview.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789025445874","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15169288,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"646004b728c37255b6fe9c1e9aa475e0ee6aa3a2adda6dd52d29a8f33c4dd3c2"}],"checke